{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有，X在S03、S11等较短段落里按音乐小节连续出现的感受点较密，稍微漏看就不如Y的静态右栏方便回扫。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"Y\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"X\",\n    \"whole\": \"X\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"Y的左右栏结构更稳定，普通观众可以快速扫读，但右侧感受词比较像集中罗列，音乐中的情绪变化不够容易追踪。X通过【】突出每段关键判断，又把具体音型、身体反应和心理变化按音乐进程展开，使人物既怀念亲近、又不愿回去受气的矛盾更清楚，前后也形成了从失落、挣扎到接纳和继续生活的完整发展。综合来看，X在理解深度、心理因果和感受细腻度上的优势，大于它在局部扫读便利性上的劣势。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "11ebd85b-b825-421e-9536-ce17fc977be9", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261108T052929253494Z", "elapsed_seconds": 75.422, "completed_utc": "2026-11-08T05:30:44.699110+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "811782de6265793172957a3b1f071d2d0bf7ea01e9a451369e0c4cee0a5e319a", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3